# AWF governance ownership. Auto-requests review from the owner on changes to
# protected paths. On a single-maintainer repository do NOT enable
# "Require review from Code Owners" in the ruleset: a PR author cannot approve
# their own PR and merges will deadlock. Enable it only with two or more owners.
/AGENTS.md                @maintainer
/PROJECT_INSTRUCTIONS.md  @maintainer
/.agentic/                @maintainer
/.github/                 @maintainer
/.codex/                  @maintainer
/SECURITY.md              @maintainer
/CODEOWNERS               @maintainer
